{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う\nございました！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、せいたん、さゆにゃんの\n仲良しレーンでしたあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん大好きっ！\nめっちゃ楽しかったあ～ ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートでできてる、\nキノコちゃんカワイイでしょ(*^p^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからね、昨日はクリスマスイヴだったので\nさゆにゃんサンタからプレゼントを"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと、一緒にお買い物してきて\n買ってきたんだよお～っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは、お花がすきだから\n可愛くてお花のいい香りがするやつを\n買ってきたの(o^^o)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事とか学校とかで疲れたときには\nみなさんの癒しになれたらいいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/25/1627824/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方、おめでとお～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog